            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="https://www.avma.org/resources/pet-owners/petcare/senior-pets" rel="noopener nofollow" target="_blank" class="rounded text-brand-accent underline decoration-brand-border underline-offset-4 transition hover:text-brand-primary focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-primary/35">AVMA. Senior pets: increased veterinary care.</a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="https://wsava.org/wp-content/uploads/2020/01/Body-Condition-Score-Dog.pdf" rel="noopener nofollow" target="_blank" class="rounded text-brand-accent underline decoration-brand-border underline-offset-4 transition hover:text-brand-primary focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-primary/35">WSAVA. Body Condition Score (Dog).</a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="https://www.msdvetmanual.com/behavior/behavior-of-dogs/aging-and-cognitive-dysfunction-in-dogs" rel="noopener nofollow" target="_blank" class="rounded text-brand-accent underline decoration-brand-border underline-offset-4 transition hover:text-brand-primary focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-primary/35">MSD Vet Manual. Aging & Cognitive Dysfunction in Dogs.</a>
